[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Redrob pairing
Name[ko]=Redrob 페어링
Comment=Shows the one-time pairing code while this device is not paired with a phone yet
Comment[ko]=이 기기가 아직 휴대전화와 페어링되지 않았을 때 일회용 페어링 코드를 보여 줍니다
# notify mode: reads /run/redrob-pairing/pairing.json written by redrob-pairing.service
# (root, every 30 s) and shows a desktop notification while a pairing code exists.
# Exits by itself once the device is paired (no code), so nothing lingers.
Exec=/usr/bin/redrob-pairing --notify
Icon=redrob-os
Terminal=false
NoDisplay=true
OnlyShowIn=Redrob;
